<!--
  Hand-made test city near Tbilisi (UTM 38N). City square lat 41.70-41.75, lon 44.70-44.80, split into
  West (r1001, admin_level 6) and East (r1002, admin_level 10) subareas at lon 44.75.
  r1003 is an admin boundary inside West that is NOT a subarea and must not become a district.
  Roads:
    w2001 + w2002  "Split Street" / "Split  Street"   share node 202 -> one merged street
    w2003, w2004   "Twin Street" 2.2 km apart        -> two streets
    w2005          unnamed residential               -> dropped
    w2007 service, w2009 footway, w2010 access=private, w2011 primary_link -> dropped
    w2006          "Cross Avenue" (primary), ~830 m in each district -> both districts
    w2008          "Edge Lane" (tertiary), ~83 m (17 %) in East -> West only
    w2012 + w2013  "North Road" and "Ridge Road" share node 221   -> a junction (road graph)
    w2014          "Bridge Road" crosses North Road with no shared node -> no junction there
  Places drawn as areas:
    r1004 quarter "შუა" (lat 41.705-41.745, lon 44.705-44.735)              -> neighbourhood
    w114 / w115 neighbourhoods "ტყუპი" around Twin Street w2003            -> only the smaller w114
    w116 neighbourhood "ცარიელი" with no streets                            -> dropped as too thin
    w118 "ჩრდილოეთი" (lon 44.752-44.790) and w119 "გზაჯვარედინი" (lon 44.750-44.755) overlap on
    Cross Avenue (665 m and 415 m of it)                                    -> chunk neighbours
  Routes (w2101-w2104, r3001) east of the river crossing:
    w2101 + w2105 "East Street" (secondary) 901-902-903; w2102 + w2106 "Turn Street" one-way north
    904-902-905; r3001 no_left_turn from w2101 via 902 onto w2106; a restriction whose ways pass
    through the via node (r3002) is left out; w2103 unnamed 903-906-907
    (a connector); w2104 bridge "Test Bridge" 907-908 over the river; n910 fuel "Test Fuel" at 902;
    n911 a statue (a landmark), n912 a plaque (too small to see from a car), n913 a chain pharmacy
    (no landmark) and w2110 "Test Park" (an area, with its outline) off any junction
  Lane families (w2015-w2022), "ტყის ..." (Forest ...):
    w2015 ტყის ქუჩა north-west, w2021 a second ტყის ქუჩა 6 km south-east
    w2016 ტყის I შესახვევი and w2017 ტყის II ჩიხი beside w2015, w2019 ტყის I შესახვევის I ჩიხი on w2016
    w2018 ტყის III გასასვლელი beside w2021 (its nearer parent), w2022 ტყის IV ჩიხი 2 km off (orphan)
    w2020 ტყის შესახვევი has no numeral                                      -> not a family
  City params (test/sql.test.ts): centre at Split Street's middle, river west to east along lat 41.725.
-->
